WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:90% align:center
Three out of four equal parts.
The denominator is 4. The numerator is 3.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000 line:90% align:center
Turn the fraction into a decimal.
3 ÷ 4 = 0.75

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:90% align:center
Turn the decimal into a percentage.
0.75 × 100 = 75%

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:90% align:center
One amount, three ways to write it.
Remember: 3/4 = 0.75 = 75%
